\section{Classification of Structural Assignment Regimes}

\subsection{Conditional Classification}

The results give a conditional branch classification after the comparison and readout hypotheses have been checked:

\begin{center}
\begin{tabular}{|l|l|l|}
\hline
\textbf{Identity Class} & \textbf{$M_\Omega$} & \textbf{Admissible Phenomenology} \\
\hline
Null label & $= 0$ & Domain/readout link required \\
\hline
Deformable & $(0, \infty)$ & Positive witness and lower bound \\
\hline
Rigid (CCR) & $= +\infty$ & Regular readout / fixed transport \\
