\begin{proposition}[Indexed Continuity Descriptors on the Same Infinite Plant]
\label{prop:asymmetric-native-subject}
Complete the preceding life protocol with the following fixed comparisons,
on the same plant and horizon. The resulting baseline descriptors are
\[
 \Priv=3/2048,\qquad \SelfDisc=1/128,\qquad
 \SelfModel=179/240,\qquad \Own=1/2.
\]
With thresholds $3/4096,1/256,1/2,1/16384$, respectively, the complete baseline
