For ownership draw a fair event sign r, assign reference $(1+r)/2$ before
observing any response, and command opposite pulses of amplitude $a_2/2$
on the indexed and partner ports at coordinate 2, starting from $\bar z$.
The normalized indexed deviation $8(z_2^{\rm self\prime}-\bar z_2^{\rm self})/a_2$
