Every comparison above is a declared window experiment on the same complete
plant and full global certificate, with preparation, reference and comparator
domains recorded. Positivity is required on the baseline/faithful-control
domain, not asserted after the diagnostic lesion has changed the model or
its comparison data. The preceding life proposition and the global six
