of Definition~\ref{def:operational-subjecthood} on that domain.
\end{proof}

\paragraph{Common plant versus common preparation.}
All strata above use the same law, state space, support, channels, costs and
two-step clock. The joint protocol records the stratum before randomization;
its task-specific preparation and relevant reading are part of the complete
instrumented model. It is not a claim that one unperturbed trajectory alone
identifies every descriptor. In particular the historical partial-channel
contract does not replace the complete channels used by the global product
comparison. Matched passive recovery, memoryless amplitude controls and
full-current-information controls remain distinct checks.

\section{Conclusion}
This paper introduces a higher-order classificatory layer for the causally rigid corpus. It defines viability-and-recovery criterion, structural class, and indexed continuity-and-control criterion in a form that is formal enough to be tested, restrictive enough to avoid inflation, and continuous with the established burdens of the framework. Six-predicate operational criterion is inherited rather than reinvented. Indexed continuity-and-control criterion is made explicitly stronger than either viability-and-recovery criterion or six-predicate operational criterion alone. Structural class is made the descriptor-relative ambient geometry in which those predicates can be transported, falsified, and compared.

The paper therefore closes four things at the formal level: the class vocabulary, the class-separation logic, the runtime-binding interface, and the principal failure grammar. It leaves four things explicitly open: empirical instantiation of any present system, external validation, metaphysical interpretation, and biological equivalence claims. That asymmetry is deliberate.

The result offers neither a philosophical doctrine nor a metaphysical closure. It is a disciplined extension of the corpus: a formal framework in which life, consciousness, and subjecthood predicates are treated as non-identical operational classes with explicit burdens, explicit diagnostics, explicit falsifiers, and explicit non-claims. If the framework fails under admissible tests, it should be rejected. If it survives, it does so solely as a formal and operational structure.

\section{Interpretation and Open Research Links}\label{sec:interpretation-open-links}
\paragraph{Historical alias.} Operational Life, Structural Class, and Subjecthood. The alias is retained for bibliographic continuity; the technical title states the demonstrated object.

\paragraph{Formal anchor.} Results \ref{prop:matched-active-recovery}, \ref{prop:history-capacity-control} and \ref{prop:writable-tower-subject-descriptors}.

\paragraph{Proposed interpretation.} The life and subjecthood aliases motivate organization, recovery and indexed continuity. These labels do not identify biological life or a subject of experience.

\paragraph{Additional obligations.} Internal provenance, matched capacity and a jointly realized upstream certificate are distinct burdens; active return alone does not establish intrinsic autonomy.

\paragraph{Differential tests and evidence.} Ablate controller links and historical access, match intervention costs and include memoryless and external-controller controls.



