\section{Formal Dependency Stack}

The external adjudication stack is layered across progressive protocol tiers. These tier identifiers denote formal dependencies in the protocol design; listing them does not certify that any operational gate has been executed or passed:

\begin{enumerate}
\item \textbf{BaseCore}: active mathematical base layer.
