Tier P4 specifies a formal provenance-closure classification. A recorded specification state may be classified as:

\begin{itemize}
\item \texttt{\detokenize{exact_}\allowbreak{}\detokenize{head_}\allowbreak{}\detokenize{aligned}};
\item \texttt{\detokenize{artifact_}\allowbreak{}\detokenize{forward_}\allowbreak{}\detokenize{compatib}\allowbreak{}\detokenize{le}};
