\section{Instantiated-Empty Record Layer}

Tier P4 moves beyond package-level specifications by defining
typed-but-empty records that remain explicitly non-evidential (Appendices~\ref{app:selection-contracts}--\ref{app:execution-records}):

\begin{itemize}
\item local frozen-record template (Appendix~\ref{app:selection-contracts})
\item reviewer candidate-pool template (Appendix~\ref{app:selection-contracts})
